# Chrome extension dev — agent vs extension reload

## Agents (automatic — do not ask the user to restart the agent)

After changing `remotes/c_remote_browser/**` or before sheet batch writes when IPC/sheets ops fail:

1. Run from repo root: `.\_\scripts\dev\restart_chrome_remote_agent.ps1`
2. Call `browser.agent.restart` on the paired device (or rely on `browser.sheets.row_set` auto-retry).
3. Wait ~5s, then retry.

`browser.sheets.row_set` calls `agent.restart` and retries once on stale agent errors.

## Extension reload (tell the user only when needed)

Ask the user to reload Alien AI Remote on chrome://extensions only when `dist/` or `manifest.json` changed and `browser.extension` version is still old after `sync_chrome_extension_install.ps1`.

## Sheet writes

Prefer `browser.sheets.row_set` for G-L, not six `cell_set` calls.